{
  "_comment": [
    "The Spec Tree questionnaire, ported from questionnaire-wizard_13.html.",
    "",
    "The mockup expressed branching as JavaScript next() closures. Those cannot",
    "cross to the server, and the server must be able to evaluate the branching",
    "itself — otherwise a hand-written POST could claim any set of fields it",
    "liked and the tree would be whatever the client said it was.",
    "",
    "So branching is declarative here:",
    "  next: a question id, or a list of rules tried in order.",
    "  rule.when.answer      — this question's answer is one of these options",
    "  rule.when.answer_of   — some other question's answer is one of these",
    "  rule.auto             — answer another question automatically and take",
    "                          its fields (used where one answer makes another",
    "                          question physically impossible)",
    "  rule.add_fields       — fields triggered by the branch rather than by a",
    "                          single option",
    "  a rule with no 'when' always matches, and is the fallback.",
    "",
    "aliases maps a questionnaire label onto the canonical field it already is,",
    "so the wizard's 'Intake Valve Clearance' does not become a second field",
    "beside the CB919 sheet's 'Valve Clearance — Intake'."
  ],
  "aliases": {
    "Intake Valve Clearance": "Valve Clearance — Intake",
    "Exhaust Valve Clearance": "Valve Clearance — Exhaust",
    "Front Brake Fluid Type": "Front Brake Fluid",
    "Rear Brake Fluid Type": "Rear Brake Fluid",
    "Chain": "Drive Chain",
    "Chain Length": "Chain Length (Links)",
    "Front Brake Pads (Qty: 2 required)": "Front Brake Pads",
    "Fuel System: Fuel Injection (noted — fields TBD)": "Fuel System",
    "Cylinder Config: Inline — shared/grouped field per cylinder count": "Cylinder Configuration",
    "Front/Rear Cylinder Config: Front-and-Rear grouping": "Cylinder Configuration",
    "Left/Right Cylinder Config: Boxer grouping": "Cylinder Configuration",
    "Head Light Bulb (Qty: 2 required)": "Head Light Bulb"
  },
  "bike_types": [
    "Dirt bike / Off-road",
